D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9F%E5%93%A5%E9%BB%91%E9%87%91%E5%8D%A1%3C%2Fa%3E%E5%85%91%E6%8D%A2%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%97%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1721439919547\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/09/09/50494840/59873994aec9132bcfa3d2103bee8b70_3907113500145428119.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">294</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">16</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「天生剑胎」。早在少女尚不知「江湖」为何物之时，这一评断便已为她錾刻下了人生的轨迹。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">千里求师，沙洲试剑，江湖诡谲，风雨飘摇。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在这个名为「江湖」的熔炉中，少女与许多人相遇，亦与许多人作别。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">唯有胸中剑意，掌中之器，如最为忠诚的旅伴，照拂少女百年岁月。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">潜蛟随影</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:18秒]挥动一把斩浪之锋劈向目标，造成600.0%攻击力冰冻元素伤害，并制造一道【激流】，持续25秒，重复触发刷新持续时间；【激流】存在期间，具有冰冻元素伤害特性的角色对该敌人造成伤害时额外产生一次回浪，造成60.0%攻击力冰冻元素伤害，至多产生5次回浪，最小触发间隔2秒。玉骑士 · 月痕在剑阵上使用时，可以直接衔接一次【回风万刃】</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">幽幽胧明</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用武器技后，全队造成的冰元素伤害提高20.0%，持续22秒（唯一生效）。玉骑士 · 月痕装备时，每当【激流】产生一次回浪，回复12.0点能量，触发冷却2秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">精准补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">第四十五期（V7.7）作战工坊限时兑换</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2240%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7