8E%A5%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E3%80%90%E5%9B%9E%E9%A3%8E%E4%B8%87%E5%88%83%E3%80%91%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%9E%E5%A4%8D%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%9A%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E4%BA%86%E5%85%B6%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%9D%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1664555349047\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/09/28/50494840/bfec5086660406a92164d7aa44300883_679413169623533768.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>玉骑士 · 月痕</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提升循环能力和全队的冰伤，拓展了角色的玩法机制。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/10/01/50494840/2d5bdfd16e6e8726085549f27e5a7879_4744512895555115012.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">主动技造成冰元素伤害，释放后提升全队冰伤，具有一定的辅助能力。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">非玉骑士 · 月痕角色使用时，可享受到该武器的伤害增益，但缺少循环回复能力，因此在考虑其他角色搭配时，更倾向于短流程中的使用；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">玉骑士 · 月痕使用时，在剑阵上释放武器主动后可衔接一次【回风万刃】，且后续能回复较多能量，满足了其必杀技高额的能量需求。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/10/01/50494840/2d5bdfd16e6e8726085549f27e5a7879_4744512895555115012.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
